### class-service on your PC (Lab 4) - start it first:  cd services/class-service && npm run dev
### Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension and click "Send Request".
### For requests that need a token: sign in with identity/requests.http first and paste the accessToken.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@token = PASTE-ACCESS-TOKEN-HERE

### Health -> 200, runtime pc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Timetable (no sign-in needed) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes

### Bad filter -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes?category=karate

### Studios -> 200 (needs a token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a class as a trainer -> 201, or 409 SCHEDULING_RULES_FAILED with the broken rules
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Morning Yoga", "category": "yoga", "studioId": "5e2a7c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "startTime": "2026-12-01T08:00:00+02:00", "durationMin": 60, "capacity": 12, "publish": true }

### Unknown class -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
